              "text": "43",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abena Levi nabo abali abana baume bakwa Yeshua, abali mu lupwa lwakwa Kadimieli abafyelwe ukupitila mu bana baume bakwa Hodafiya, bonse bali amakumi cine lubali na bane (74).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
