          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "65",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.65",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.65"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "66",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:66"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "66",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kanshi ulukuta lonse ulwabwelele ukufuma kuli bunkole lwali pamo amakana amakumi yane na yabili ne myanda itatu na makumi mutanda (42,360). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.66",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.66"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "67",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:67"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "67",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili ababomfi babo abaume na banakashi bambi bali amakana cine lubali ne myanda itatu na makumi yatatu na cine lubali (7,337). Balikwete na bakwimba inyimbo, abaume elyo na banakashi, abali imyanda ibili na makumi yane na yasano (245). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.67",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.67"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "68",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:68"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "68",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Imfalashi shabo shali imyanda cine lubali na makumi yatatu na mutanda (736). Elyo bakabalwe babo bali imyanda ibili na makumi yane na basano (245). ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.68",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.68"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "69",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:69"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "69",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ingamila nasho shali imyanda ine na makumi yatatu na shisano (435). Bapunda nabo amakana mutanda ne myanda cine lubali na makumi yabili (6,720).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.69",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.69"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "69",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "NEH 7:69"
          },
          "items": [
            {
